       fhir:ElementDefinition.short [ fhir:value "Details zur geplanten Abgabe des Arzneimittels." ] ;
       fhir:ElementDefinition.definition [ fhir:value "Indicates the specific details for the dispense or medication supply part of a medication request (also known as a Medication Prescription or Medication Order).  Note that this information is not always sent with the order.  There may be in some settings (e.g. hospitals) institutional or system support for completing the dispense details in the pharmacy department." ] ;
